# Registro no manifesto de fronteiras: <nome>|<diretório relativo à raiz>|<dependências separadas por vírgula>.
# Vírgula e não ponto e vírgula, para o item não ser quebrado como lista da propriedade.
function(oly_register_target property name directory)
  file(RELATIVE_PATH relativeDirectory ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR} ${directory})
  list(JOIN ARGN "," dependencies)
  set_property(GLOBAL APPEND PROPERTY ${property} "${name}|${relativeDirectory}|${dependencies}")
endfunction()

# oly_add_module(NAME <m> [DEPENDS <m...>] [OBJECT | HEADER_ONLY])
function(oly_add_module)
  cmake_parse_arguments(MODULE "OBJECT;HEADER_ONLY" "NAME" "DEPENDS" ${ARGN})
  set(target oly_${MODULE_NAME})

  if(MODULE_HEADER_ONLY)
    add_library(${target} INTERFACE)
    target_include_directories(${target} INTERFACE ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include)
    target_compile_features(${target} INTERFACE cxx_std_20)
    set(visibility INTERFACE)
  else()
    file(GLOB moduleSources CONFIGURE_DEPENDS ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/src/*.cpp)
    if(MODULE_OBJECT)
      add_library(${target} OBJECT ${moduleSources})
    else()
      add_library(${target} STATIC ${moduleSources})
    endif()
    target_include_directories(${target} PUBLIC ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/include)
    target_compile_features(${target} PUBLIC cxx_std_20)
    oly_warnings(${target})
    set(visibility PUBLIC)
  endif()

  add_library(oly::${MODULE_NAME} ALIAS ${target})
  foreach(dependency IN LISTS MODULE_DEPENDS)
    target_link_libraries(${target} ${visibility} oly::${dependency})
  endforeach()

  oly_register_target(OLY_MODULES ${MODULE_NAME} ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR} ${MODULE_DEPENDS})
endfunction()

# oly_add_test(MODULE <m> NAME <suíte> SOURCES <arqs...> [SUPPORT <dirs...>])
function(oly_add_test)
  cmake_parse_arguments(TEST "" "MODULE;NAME" "SOURCES;SUPPORT" ${ARGN})
  set(target ${TEST_MODULE}_${TEST_NAME})

  add_executable(${target} ${TEST_SOURCES} ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/engine/runtime/core/tests/support/doctest_main.cpp)
  target_link_libraries(${target} PRIVATE oly::${TEST_MODULE} doctest::doctest)

  target_include_directories(${target} PRIVATE ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/support)
  foreach(supportDirectory IN LISTS TEST_SUPPORT)
    cmake_path(ABSOLUTE_PATH supportDirectory BASE_DIRECTORY ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR})
    target_include_directories(${target} PRIVATE ${supportDirectory})
  endforeach()

  set_target_properties(${target} PROPERTIES RUNTIME_OUTPUT_DIRECTORY ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/tests)
  oly_warnings(${target})
  oly_wasm_exceptions(${target})
  oly_wasm_node_env(${target})

  add_test(NAME ${TEST_MODULE}.${TEST_NAME} COMMAND ${target})
endfunction()

# oly_add_contract_death(MODULE <m> SOURCE <arq> CASES <casos...>)
# Testes de morte: um executável próprio, só com asserts ligados; um teste ctest por caso.
function(oly_add_contract_death)
  cmake_parse_arguments(DEATH "" "MODULE;SOURCE" "CASES" ${ARGN})
  if(NOT OLY_ASSERTS_ENABLED)
    return()
  endif()

  set(target ${DEATH_MODULE}_contract_death)
  add_executable(${target} ${DEATH_SOURCE})
  target_link_libraries(${target} PRIVATE oly::${DEATH_MODULE})
  target_include_directories(${target} PRIVATE ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/support)
  set_target_properties(${target} PROPERTIES RUNTIME_OUTPUT_DIRECTORY ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/tests)
  oly_warnings(${target})

  foreach(deathCase IN LISTS DEATH_CASES)
    add_test(NAME ${DEATH_MODULE}.contract_death.${deathCase} COMMAND ${target} ${deathCase})
  endforeach()
endfunction()

# oly_add_bench(MODULE <m> NAME <n> SOURCES <arqs...>)
function(oly_add_bench)
  cmake_parse_arguments(BENCH "" "MODULE;NAME" "SOURCES" ${ARGN})
  set(target ${BENCH_MODULE}_bench_${BENCH_NAME})

  add_executable(${target} ${BENCH_SOURCES})
  target_link_libraries(${target} PRIVATE oly::${BENCH_MODULE} benchmark::benchmark)
  target_include_directories(${target} PRIVATE ${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR})
  set_target_properties(${target} PROPERTIES RUNTIME_OUTPUT_DIRECTORY ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/bench)
  oly_warnings(${target})

  if(EMSCRIPTEN)
    # benchmark 1.8.3 desliga o inline asm no Emscripten: lá só existe DoNotOptimize(const&), obsoleta.
    target_compile_options(${target} PRIVATE -Wno-deprecated-declarations)
  endif()

  if(OLY_VEC_REPORT)
    if(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID STREQUAL "GNU")
      target_compile_options(${target} PRIVATE -fopt-info-vec-optimized)
    elseif(CMAKE_CXX_COMPILER_ID MATCHES "Clang")
      target_compile_options(${target} PRIVATE -Rpass=loop-vectorize)
    endif()
  endif()
endfunction()
